From 58fbfc3115675457fb05ccd1fca90ddf68280fbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:53:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add RKC Plank, Dead Bug, Bird Dog and Pallof Press exercises

Adds four core-stability exercises to the catalog, each with a matching
form-guidance entry (required by the form-notes coverage test):

- RKC Plank: timed hold
- Dead Bug, Bird Dog: bodyweight, logged as total alternating reps
  (same as Russian Twist)
- Pallof Press: cable, unilateral weight + reps

All use the "core" rest category. No schema or storage changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YWZmJ5eNSc5YmBhwR2bTA3
---
 src/lib/exerciseFormNotes.ts | 46 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/lib/exercises.ts         | 18 ++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 63 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/lib/exerciseFormNotes.ts b/src/lib/exerciseFormNotes.ts
index 47c8cfe..d02ba27 100644
--- a/src/lib/exerciseFormNotes.ts
+++ b/src/lib/exerciseFormNotes.ts
